      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Yet another great day outdoors! We plan on doing more technical and/or longer hikes with Shasta and today was one of those &lsquo;dry-runs&rsquo;. We were out there in the woods for about 3.5 hours and she did terrific!</p>
<p>A decent elevation profile, blended in river-crossing, and of-course wonderful company. With an early start, the 6.5miles didn&rsquo;t quite feel that distance. A bit of a drive from home that was absolutely worth it!</p>
<p>@Gun Powder falls State Park.</p>
